id: tz_non_secure_execution_prebuilt
label: TrustZone Non-Secure Execution
description: >
  Recommended TrustZone startup that hands off from Secure to Non-Secure world. The
  implementation is prebuilt and embedded as a C byte array; it is produced from the same
  sources as the source component, but linked so it can be flashed via the Non-Secure
  flash alias while execution still uses the Secure alias. Prefer this prebuilt component
  for normal integrations. The source component exists mainly as an auditable reference
  and for debugging when you need to build the logic in-tree.
package: platform_core
category: Platform|TrustZone
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
root_path: platform_core/platform/common
source:
- path: src/sl_tz_non_secure_execution.c
provides:
- name: tz_non_secure_execution_prebuilt
- name: tz_non_secure_execution_impl
  condition: [device_has_deepsleep_retention]
- name: tz_non_secure_execution_flash_only
requires:
- name: device_has_deepsleep_retention
